  "title": "Why You Can't Trust the Video Interview Anymore",
  "summary": "Real-time AI overlays, deepfake video, and proxy interviewers let candidates fake their way through video interviews — the performance you evaluate may not belong to the person you hire. Detection is a losing arms race; the fix is verifying employment in parallel with interviews, not after the offer.",
